Open in Storybook ↗ <p>Toasts use Sonner-style stacking: the newest toast is in front, older toasts scale down behind it, and hovering expands the full stack. Only 3 toasts are visible by default in the collapsed state.</p> <p>On touch devices, horizontal swipe dismisses toasts (threshold: 45px or velocity &gt; 0.11px/ms).</p> <p>The auto-dismiss timer (default 3000ms) pauses on hover. Set <code>timeout: false</code> for persistent toasts.</p> <pre><code>notification("Quick flash", { timeout: 1500 });
