Open in Storybook ↗ <p>When <code>loading</code> is <code>true</code>, the button shows a spinner in place of its icon and becomes non-interactive:</p> <pre><code>&lt;VcButton variant="primary" :loading="isSaving" @click="save"&gt;
  Save Changes
&lt;/VcButton&gt;
